#: src/contributors/09-api-v4.md:1
msgid "API v4 Upgrade Guide"
msgstr ""

#: src/contributors/09-api-v4.md:3
msgid ""
"This document outlines the main changes between API v3 (Lemmy 0.19) and API "
"v4 (Lemmy 1.0). You can use the following resources to adapt the new API:"
msgstr ""

#: src/contributors/09-api-v4.md:5
msgid ""
"[Official API docs (including OpenAPI spec)](https://join-lemmy.org/api/main)"
msgstr ""

#: src/contributors/09-api-v4.md:6
msgid ""
"Browse [voyager.lemmy.ml](https://voyager.lemmy.ml), and use the browser "
"console to see which API requests are made"
msgstr ""

#: src/contributors/09-api-v4.md:7
msgid ""
"Look at the relevant pull requests for a given feature in lemmy-ui (eg "
"[notifications](https://github.com/LemmyNet/lemmy-ui/pulls?"
"q=is%3Apr+notifications+is%3Aclosed+))"
msgstr ""

#: src/contributors/09-api-v4.md:9
msgid ""
"Note that this document only covers changes to existing features, not new "
"features. If any breaking changes are missing, please make a pull request to "
"[this file](https://github.com/LemmyNet/lemmy-docs/blob/main/src/"
"contributors/09-api-v4.md). If you have any questions, use the [development "
"chat on matrix](https://matrix.to/#/#lemmydev:matrix.org) or [/c/lemmy-"
"support](https://lemmy.ml/c/lemmy_support)."
msgstr ""

